  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained attacks increase insurance and operational risk for transoceanic hardware deployments, incentivizing corporations and states to accelerate capital deployment into onshore/regional cloud and AI infrastructure as a resilience/decoupling response.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
