  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Visible increases in missile/drone/small-boat attacks in the Russia‑Ukraine theatre produce a demonstration and tactics-transfer effect that accelerates adoption of similar maritime attack patterns by regional actors (including proxies), raising the rate of hostile incidents in the US–Iran maritime theatre.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
