  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained rerouting of commercial traffic away from Black Sea/Ukraine routes increases demand on alternative global corridors (Suez/Strait of Hormuz), mechanically raising crude and oil-product volumes transiting those chokepoints.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_maritime_standof</data>
</edge>
