  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">A rapid uptick in AI infrastructure spending raises near‑term demand for construction, power, semiconductors and logistics, tightening capacity in those markets and causing realized inflation to overshoot prevailing forecasts.</data>
