  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A measurable increase in domestic semiconductor production capacity provides alternative supply for critical chips, enabling targeted economies to run indigenous hardware stacks and routing/telecom infrastructure that bypasses vendors subject to export controls, directly boosting their ability to evade hardware-dependent sanctions.</data>
