  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharper export controls and restrictive tech-related regulations from the U.S. and allies raise perceived exposure to Western payment/finance systems, prompting BRICS actors to accelerate adoption and integration of alternative cross‑border payment rails to reduce dependency and transactional surveillance.</data>
