  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Heightened uncertainty about major central bank policy increases perceived geopolitical economic risk and prompts BRICS policymakers to seek more reliable credit, trade and diplomatic partners, accelerating shifts toward alternative strategic alignments.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">bond_inflation_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">brics_global_realignment</data>
</edge>
