  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Elevated uncertainty about the timing/intensity of monetary-policy moves tightens venture and corporate financing conditions and risk appetite, reducing funding for compute‑intensive model development and slowing the pace of new large model projects.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">bond_inflation_shock</data>
