  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained rise in advanced‑economy sovereign yields raises the cost and volatility of dollar/Western funding, incentivising BRICS banks and states to accelerate integration of non‑Western payment rails and bilateral clearing arrangements to lower transaction and funding risk.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">bond_inflation_shock</data>
