  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising sovereign yields increase the cost of trade finance and ship refinancing, prompting carriers and charterers to cancel sailings or withdraw capacity and thereby reduce commercial transit volume through the region.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">bond_inflation_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
