  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A material rise in sovereign yields raises trade finance and shipping borrowing costs and insurance premia, causing some chartering and trade flows to be delayed or reduced and lowering volumetric flows through strategic chokepoints.</data>
