  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">A fall in net cross‑border capital flows after an inflation shock limits foreign equity and project financing for data‑center builds and cloud rollouts, directly reducing additions to operational data‑center capacity.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">bond_inflation_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
