  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sudden capital outflows from oil‑importing countries weaken local currencies and constrain import financing, leading to reduced crude and product liftings and lower tanker transits through key chokepoints.</data>
