<edge source="brics_global_realignment::currency_and_capital_sta" target="bond_inflation_shock::sovereign_yield_curve" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Deterioration in exchange-rate stability and accelerated capital flight raises sovereign risk and liquidity premia, driving up yields across maturities and often steepening the term structure as investors demand compensation for currency and rollover risk.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">brics_global_realignment</data>
  <data key="d39">bond_inflation_shock</data>
</edge>
